---
title: Viewing Geotechnical Data on 3D Web Map
description: Learn how to transform geotechnical files for viewing on a 3D web map using CesiumJS
draft: true
---

**What you'll build:** An interactive web map that displays your geotechnical investigation data in 3D, making it accessible to anyone with a web browser.

**You'll learn to:** Transform AGS files into web-friendly formats and create a clickable map showing borehole locations and in-situ tests like Standard Penetration Tests and Weathering Grades.

**Time needed:** 30-45 minutes

**Result:** A single web page stakeholders can open anywhere to explore your ground investigation results.

Instead of sharing folders of specialized files, you'll have a 3D web visualization that works on any device without special software.

Here's the end result:

